# `vite build --mode static` (npm run build:static): a build that needs no
# backend of its own, for GitHub Pages, Cloudflare Pages or any static host.
# Signaling goes through a PeerJS server; override any of these with real
# environment variables at build time (see README → Static hosting).
VITE_SIGNALING=peerjs
# VITE_PEERJS_URL=wss://0.peerjs.com/peerjs
# VITE_PEERJS_KEY=peerjs
# VITE_ICE_SERVERS=[{"urls":"stun:stun.l.google.com:19302"}]
# VITE_PUBLIC_URL=https://drop.example.com
